  "budgetNotes": "budgetMs is a CEILING on p95 at the worst point of the growth axis. It records what the engine must not exceed, which is not the same as what it should cost: where the two differ the note says so. Derived budgets are 1.5x the measurement; hand-set ones carry a note explaining the decision.",
