      "class": "interactive",
      "measuredMs": 4.3024,
      "note": "4.30 ms p95 at 1000 stamps is ALREADY outside the engine's half of a 120 Hz frame (4.17 ms), and grows as N^0.65. This budget is a regression ceiling on today's behaviour, NOT a statement that it is fast enough. The checker reports the frame-share breach on every run so it stays visible instead of being retired by being written down."
    },
